WEBVTT

1
00:01:33.333 --> 00:01:36.000
In the previous verses, Lord Krishna

2
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.500
described His presence in
the Vedas, mountains,

3
00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:40.500
and constellations.

4
00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.916
Now in these five verses, in music,

5
00:01:42.916 --> 00:01:44.333
time, qualities,

6
00:01:44.333 --> 00:01:45.291
and knowledge too,

7
00:01:45.291 --> 00:01:48.083
He reveals His manifestation.

8
00:01:48.083 --> 00:01:51.083
In this section of the tenth chapter, Lord Krishna

9
00:01:51.083 --> 00:01:54.625
continues to reveal His divine manifestations.

10
00:01:54.625 --> 00:01:55.666
He shows His presence

11
00:01:55.666 --> 00:01:58.708
in various aspects of creation.

12
00:01:58.708 --> 00:01:59.375
His power

13
00:01:59.375 --> 00:02:02.041
resides in all extraordinary qualities.

14
00:02:02.041 --> 00:02:05.958
His presence dwells in the very foundation of life.

15
00:02:05.958 --> 00:02:07.833
By understanding His vibhutis,

16
00:02:07.833 --> 00:02:09.208
we can see Lord Krishna

17
00:02:09.208 --> 00:02:11.166
in everything.

18
00:02:11.166 --> 00:02:15.166
This understanding leads
us toward humility and reverence.

19
00:02:20.041 --> 00:02:23.041
In these five verses too, Lord Krishna

20
00:02:23.041 --> 00:02:27.000
reveals His vibhuti across different existences.

21
00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:30.083
In verse 10.35, Lord Krishna says

22
00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:31.708
that among the melodious hymns

23
00:02:31.708 --> 00:02:34.583
of the Sama Veda, He is the Brihatsaman.

24
00:02:34.583 --> 00:02:37.583
It is considered the most melodious
and divine of all tones.

25
00:02:37.583 --> 00:02:42.000
Its beauty and depth reflect Lord Krishna's glory.

26
00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:43.291
He is the Gayatri,

27
00:02:43.291 --> 00:02:46.250
also called the mother of the Vedas.

28
00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:48.666
The Gayatri is both a metre

29
00:02:48.666 --> 00:02:50.541
and a mantra.

30
00:02:50.541 --> 00:02:53.458
Chanting it for higher spiritual realisation

31
00:02:53.458 --> 00:02:54.666
reflects Lord Krishna's supreme

32
00:02:54.666 --> 00:02:57.250
knowledge.

33
00:02:57.250 --> 00:02:59.875
Lord Krishna, among the twelve

34
00:02:59.875 --> 00:03:02.916
months of the Indian calendar,
is the month of Margashirsha,

35
00:03:02.916 --> 00:03:04.375
that is, the October

36
00:03:04.375 --> 00:03:05.833
to November month,

37
00:03:05.833 --> 00:03:08.125
in which the harvest takes place.

38
00:03:08.125 --> 00:03:11.458
It is a symbol of prosperity and joy.

39
00:03:11.458 --> 00:03:13.791
Among the seasons, He is spring.

40
00:03:13.791 --> 00:03:15.625
In spring, the fragrance of flowers

41
00:03:15.625 --> 00:03:17.750
spreads everywhere.

42
00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:22.000
It represents freshness and beauty.

43
00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:25.375
In verse 10.36, gambling is mentioned.

44
00:03:25.375 --> 00:03:27.666
Though it is a form of deception

45
00:03:27.666 --> 00:03:30.500
and most people misuse it,

46
00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:31.791
But, Lord Krishna

47
00:03:31.791 --> 00:03:34.833
considers it His vibhuti, because in it

48
00:03:34.833 --> 00:03:36.000
sharp intellect

49
00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.541
and strategy are needed.

50
00:03:38.541 --> 00:03:40.583
This shows that Lord Krishna's

51
00:03:40.583 --> 00:03:43.458
greatness is all-pervading.

52
00:03:43.458 --> 00:03:44.750
The radiance and brilliance

53
00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:47.666
in individuals comes from Lord Krishna alone, whether

54
00:03:47.666 --> 00:03:48.958
physical,

55
00:03:48.958 --> 00:03:51.625
intellectual, or spiritual.

56
00:03:51.625 --> 00:03:52.583
The thrill of victory

57
00:03:52.583 --> 00:03:53.708
and courage too

58
00:03:53.708 --> 00:03:56.958
are filled with Lord Krishna's presence.

59
00:03:56.958 --> 00:03:59.916
In verse 10.37, Vasudeva means

60
00:03:59.916 --> 00:04:01.708
Lord Krishna Himself.

61
00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:04.083
Among the Pandavas,
He names Himself as Dhananjaya,

62
00:04:04.083 --> 00:04:05.750
that is, Arjun,

63
00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:06.541
acknowledging his devotion

64
00:04:06.541 --> 00:04:09.958
and the quality of being a true friend.

65
00:04:09.958 --> 00:04:12.041
Vyasa compiled the Vedas

66
00:04:12.041 --> 00:04:14.000
and composed the Mahabharata.

67
00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.375
This work established him

68
00:04:15.375 --> 00:04:17.625
as a divine rishi.

69
00:04:17.625 --> 00:04:19.000
Vyasa's this work

70
00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:22.666
is itself a reflection of Lord Krishna's wisdom.

71
00:04:22.666 --> 00:04:24.708
Ushana, or Shukracharya,

72
00:04:24.708 --> 00:04:25.708
known as the teacher

73
00:04:25.708 --> 00:04:27.416
of the Daityas,

74
00:04:27.416 --> 00:04:28.791
is renowned for his sharp intellect

75
00:04:28.791 --> 00:04:31.625
and political skill.

76
00:04:31.625 --> 00:04:34.083
These extraordinary qualities
of his too are forms

77
00:04:34.083 --> 00:04:36.416
of Lord Krishna's medha.

78
00:04:36.416 --> 00:04:37.416
In verse 10.38,

79
00:04:37.416 --> 00:04:38.541
Lord Krishna

80
00:04:38.541 --> 00:04:41.541
mentions that He is danda – punishment.

81
00:04:41.541 --> 00:04:44.375
This is the means of maintaining order.

82
00:04:44.375 --> 00:04:49.666
It shows Lord Krishna's role
in upholding justice and dharma.

83
00:04:49.666 --> 00:04:51.750
Lord Krishna's presence in niti

84
00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:54.791
shows the importance of virtue.

85
00:04:54.791 --> 00:04:57.125
The form of silence is a symbol of self-restraint

86
00:04:57.125 --> 00:04:59.083
and contemplation.

87
00:04:59.083 --> 00:05:01.833
It is the path to reaching deeper truth.

88
00:05:01.833 --> 00:05:04.916
In His form as knowledge,
there is the capacity to discern.

89
00:05:04.916 --> 00:05:06.583
This shows Lord Krishna's guidance in the lives

90
00:05:06.583 --> 00:05:09.583
of the learned.

91
00:05:09.583 --> 00:05:12.083
In verse 10.39, Lord Krishna

92
00:05:12.083 --> 00:05:14.541
clarifies His position.

93
00:05:14.541 --> 00:05:18.208
He is the source and sustainer of all creation.

94
00:05:18.208 --> 00:05:19.583
All living and non-living things,

95
00:05:19.583 --> 00:05:22.166
everything receives its existence from Him.

96
00:05:22.166 --> 00:05:24.625
He is the seed that generates life.

97
00:05:24.625 --> 00:05:28.541
He is also the power that sustains it.

98
00:05:33.083 --> 00:05:35.666
Silence

99
00:05:35.666 --> 00:05:38.875
is a powerful tool

100
00:05:38.875 --> 00:05:42.083
that helps us grow

101
00:05:42.083 --> 00:05:44.750
both inwardly

102
00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:49.000
and outwardly.

103
00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:50.625
When we

104
00:05:50.625 --> 00:05:53.333
embrace silence,

105
00:05:53.333 --> 00:05:55.000
we get the opportunity

106
00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:58.000
to understand our own thoughts

107
00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.000
and connect with the depths

108
00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.083
within us.

109
00:06:03.083 --> 00:06:05.916
Silence is not emptiness

110
00:06:05.916 --> 00:06:09.333
or void,

111
00:06:09.333 --> 00:06:11.666
because

112
00:06:11.666 --> 00:06:13.416
within it

113
00:06:13.416 --> 00:06:17.250
I am present.

114
00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:22.041
So it lifts you above the noise of daily life,

115
00:06:22.041 --> 00:06:25.833
stress, and so on,

116
00:06:25.833 --> 00:06:27.416
and gives you the opportunity

117
00:06:27.416 --> 00:06:31.583
to reach great truths.

118
00:06:31.583 --> 00:06:32.916
In silence,

119
00:06:32.916 --> 00:06:35.333
you can hear your thoughts

120
00:06:35.333 --> 00:06:38.583
more clearly,

121
00:06:38.583 --> 00:06:41.250
and recognise those tendencies

122
00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:44.333
or habits

123
00:06:44.333 --> 00:06:47.625
that need to change.

124
00:06:47.625 --> 00:06:49.875
For example,

125
00:06:49.875 --> 00:06:51.583
your colleague

126
00:06:51.583 --> 00:06:54.958
criticises you.

127
00:06:54.958 --> 00:06:57.208
Naturally,

128
00:06:57.208 --> 00:06:59.541
your first thought is

129
00:06:59.541 --> 00:07:03.000
to respond immediately.

130
00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:05.500
But pause.

131
00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:10.333
If you stop for a moment

132
00:07:10.333 --> 00:07:12.916
and remain silent,

133
00:07:12.916 --> 00:07:16.125
you can understand

134
00:07:16.125 --> 00:07:19.166
whether the criticism is true

135
00:07:19.166 --> 00:07:21.333
or false.

136
00:07:21.333 --> 00:07:25.583
Then, first remaining silent, thinking,

137
00:07:25.583 --> 00:07:28.958
and only after that giving any response,

138
00:07:28.958 --> 00:07:34.125
you benefit in every situation.

139
00:07:34.125 --> 00:07:36.750
In the quiet moments of silence,

140
00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:40.875
we can evaluate our actions,

141
00:07:40.875 --> 00:07:44.958
refine and improve our resolutions,

142
00:07:44.958 --> 00:07:48.708
or define them well.

143
00:07:48.708 --> 00:07:55.041
We can align them with the right goals.

144
00:07:55.041 --> 00:07:56.708
Silence

145
00:07:56.708 --> 00:08:00.791
also strengthens self-restraint.

146
00:08:00.791 --> 00:08:04.250
It teaches us the art of using only necessary

147
00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:08.166
and beneficial, gentle words.

148
00:08:08.166 --> 00:08:11.375
It helps us avoid harmful

149
00:08:11.375 --> 00:08:13.833
or impulsive words.

150
00:08:13.833 --> 00:08:18.125
By regularly practising silence, clarity,

151
00:08:18.125 --> 00:08:22.041
patience, and a sense of peace come.

152
00:08:22.041 --> 00:08:24.500
By practising silence

153
00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:26.875
for some time each day,

154
00:08:26.875 --> 00:08:28.583
you can experience

155
00:08:28.583 --> 00:08:33.250
a transformation in life.

156
00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:36.333
It helps you grow,

157
00:08:36.333 --> 00:08:41.083
promotes wisdom and self-control.

158
00:08:41.083 --> 00:08:44.875
Silence is not emptiness,

159
00:08:44.875 --> 00:08:46.375
but

160
00:08:46.375 --> 00:08:48.625
it is the doorway to deep awareness

161
00:08:48.625 --> 00:08:51.833
and strength,

162
00:08:51.833 --> 00:08:53.291
because

163
00:08:53.291 --> 00:08:55.416
in silence

164
00:08:55.416 --> 00:08:57.500
you find Me

165
00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:00.291
very close to you.

166
00:09:05.125 --> 00:09:10.083
When someone's son tells a lie,

167
00:09:10.083 --> 00:09:12.208
when their daughter

168
00:09:12.208 --> 00:09:16.208
falls into bad company,

169
00:09:16.208 --> 00:09:20.458
what do people do in such moments?

170
00:09:20.458 --> 00:09:22.791
See,

171
00:09:22.791 --> 00:09:24.416
I am present

172
00:09:24.416 --> 00:09:26.791
in discipline.

173
00:09:26.791 --> 00:09:29.791
But with love.

174
00:09:29.791 --> 00:09:31.583
It must be understood that discipline

175
00:09:31.583 --> 00:09:34.916
is not anger, it is compassion.

176
00:09:34.916 --> 00:09:38.375
Let us understand it this way.

177
00:09:38.375 --> 00:09:40.041
Suppose

178
00:09:40.041 --> 00:09:43.916
someone's child cheats in an exam.

179
00:09:43.916 --> 00:09:48.000
In such a case, people shout and hit.

180
00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:50.041
Then know

181
00:09:50.041 --> 00:09:52.166
that this discipline

182
00:09:52.166 --> 00:09:54.333
is anger.

183
00:09:54.333 --> 00:09:57.083
On the contrary, when parents

184
00:09:57.083 --> 00:10:00.000
sit and explain to the child,

185
00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.375
then in the child

186
00:10:01.375 --> 00:10:04.916
there is remorse for their wrong act.

187
00:10:04.916 --> 00:10:08.500
They undergo the true discipline of regret,

188
00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:11.791
and ultimately, they improve.

189
00:10:11.791 --> 00:10:16.375
Understand that the purpose of discipline is to teach,

190
00:10:16.375 --> 00:10:18.000
not to frighten.

191
00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:21.916
That is why when you correct with love,

192
00:10:21.916 --> 00:10:24.500
then the child understands that

193
00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:27.750
this is for my good.

194
00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:29.833
Be careful,

195
00:10:29.833 --> 00:10:33.958
never discipline in anger,

196
00:10:33.958 --> 00:10:39.166
but first become calm and think.

197
00:10:39.166 --> 00:10:41.791
Will this discipline make them better

198
00:10:41.791 --> 00:10:45.375
or worse, because remember,

199
00:10:45.375 --> 00:10:49.875
both discipline and affection are needed.

200
00:10:49.875 --> 00:10:52.750
Only love spoils a child,

201
00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:56.666
while only strictness makes them fearful.

202
00:10:56.666 --> 00:11:01.166
Balance is the key.

203
00:11:01.166 --> 00:11:05.916
When you maintain this balance
and give appropriate discipline,

204
00:11:05.916 --> 00:11:08.750
then the child respects you.

205
00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:11.458
They love you,

206
00:11:11.458 --> 00:11:13.791
because they know

207
00:11:13.791 --> 00:11:16.916
you care about their future.

208
00:11:16.916 --> 00:11:20.208
So listen to Me.

209
00:11:20.208 --> 00:11:24.208
The right to discipline exists only

210
00:11:24.208 --> 00:11:28.458
when there is love in the heart
and goodwill in the mind.

211
00:11:33.291 --> 00:11:34.291
Come, think.

212
00:11:34.291 --> 00:11:37.666
If the circumstances are such that

213
00:11:37.666 --> 00:11:40.583
you can get a big assignment,

214
00:11:40.583 --> 00:11:41.541
and for it

215
00:11:41.541 --> 00:11:45.416
you are being told to adopt unfair means.

216
00:11:45.416 --> 00:11:47.375
You can be promoted,

217
00:11:47.375 --> 00:11:51.750
but you will have to deceive a colleague.

218
00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:53.666
What do you choose?

219
00:11:53.666 --> 00:11:56.916
Then listen.

220
00:11:56.916 --> 00:11:59.875
I am in niti.

221
00:11:59.875 --> 00:12:01.958
The success

222
00:12:01.958 --> 00:12:04.208
that comes through adharma,

223
00:12:04.208 --> 00:12:06.875
that is not success,

224
00:12:06.875 --> 00:12:09.458
it is failure.

225
00:12:09.458 --> 00:12:11.291
See, a businessman

226
00:12:11.291 --> 00:12:14.458
becomes a millionaire through dishonest means.

227
00:12:14.458 --> 00:12:17.250
In a few years his business

228
00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:21.916
shuts down, because once it is discovered,

229
00:12:21.916 --> 00:12:26.000
people do not trust him.

230
00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:27.708
Another businessman

231
00:12:27.708 --> 00:12:31.250
grows slowly through honesty,

232
00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:34.250
and he is respected,

233
00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:38.875
called successful. And ethical success –

234
00:12:38.875 --> 00:12:42.625
unethical success is like a castle of sand,

235
00:12:42.625 --> 00:12:45.833
beautiful to look at, but

236
00:12:45.833 --> 00:12:48.083
it does not last.

237
00:12:48.083 --> 00:12:50.625
Ethical success

238
00:12:50.625 --> 00:12:52.458
is like a rock.

239
00:12:52.458 --> 00:12:54.833
It builds slowly, but

240
00:12:54.833 --> 00:12:58.125
it always stands.

241
00:12:58.125 --> 00:13:01.916
When you work the right way,

242
00:13:01.916 --> 00:13:07.708
then you sleep deeply and peacefully.

243
00:13:07.708 --> 00:13:11.375
The soul remains at peace.

244
00:13:11.375 --> 00:13:15.125
People trust you.

245
00:13:15.125 --> 00:13:17.166
Challenges will come.

246
00:13:17.166 --> 00:13:20.541
Tempting things will attract you.

247
00:13:20.541 --> 00:13:23.125
But listen,

248
00:13:23.125 --> 00:13:24.041
the person who

249
00:13:24.041 --> 00:13:29.541
does not abandon ethics, their victory

250
00:13:29.541 --> 00:13:32.458
is lasting.

251
00:13:32.458 --> 00:13:35.666
Remember, the true measure of success

252
00:13:35.666 --> 00:13:41.041
is not what you gained,

253
00:13:41.041 --> 00:13:43.208
but

254
00:13:43.208 --> 00:13:45.833
how you gained it.

255
00:13:45.833 --> 00:13:47.500
Success gained at the cost

256
00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:51.541
of ethics is hollow.

257
00:13:51.541 --> 00:13:54.416
Move forward with ethical strength.

258
00:13:54.416 --> 00:13:57.625
Work with integrity.

259
00:13:57.625 --> 00:14:00.416
The success that comes from this path

260
00:14:00.416 --> 00:14:03.916
will shine not from your ambition,

261
00:14:03.916 --> 00:14:07.375
but from the brilliance

262
00:14:07.375 --> 00:14:11.125
of your strong character.

263
00:14:11.125 --> 00:14:13.375
This is true victory.
